    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How long is the book?</summary>
      <p>Just under 300 pages, designed to read at your pace. Each chapter ends with short exercises so you can pause and integrate.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What if I’m buying this as a gift?</summary>
